Z||000000||fierosound||02-27-2001||11:49 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.phs-online.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.phs-online.com/</A> <P>Check out this site - Pontiac Historical Services.  $35 and your VIN# get you a complete record of your car, including dealer order/invoice, repro. window sticker, "official" model photo etc.  Worth checking out for anyone looking for their car's "birth certificate" to complete their "baby's" album...||||reg||1
