Z||000002||Formula88||02-28-2001||10:38 PM||||Definately worth it!  I did this with my 72 Trans Am back when it was free and I even got a copy of the original window sticker and sales invoice!  PHS took over the job because Pontiac couldn't handle the number of requests they were getting.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||10
